Z||000004||GT Bastard||04-29-2000||03:08 PM||||In my '94 LT1, I only had one run-in with a ricer.... It was like 2am in the morning, and this Riced-out Honda Del-Sol pulls up next to me revvin like a maniac.  We both smashed the gas when the light turned green, and I swear he wasn't half ways through the intersection when I was past the light!  I knew he was trying because I could hear him chirp his tires and I could hear that little 4-banger screaming.  When he pulled up next to me at the next light, he just shrugged... I gave him the thumbs up anyways.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||14
